      "clinician": "R. Lindqvist, RN CDCES",
      "specialty": "Diabetes Education",
      "reason": "Continuous glucose monitor training",
      "note": "Completed a forty-five minute structured training session with the patient and his spouse on the use, application, calibration and interpretation of the prescribed continuous glucose monitoring system. Covered sensor insertion technique, alert threshold configuration, trend arrow interpretation, and the response protocol for a low alert. Patient demonstrated correct sensor application on a training pad and correctly interpreted four sample trend scenarios. Spouse also trained on the follower application. Training complete; patient is ready to begin monitoring once the device is dispensed.",
      "locator": "enc/2026-06-11/diabetes-education",
      "provenance": "authored"
    },
