      "clinician": "Dr. M. Castellanos",
      "specialty": "Endocrinology",
      "reason": "Interim diabetes review",
      "note": "Interim review pending device authorisation. Patient reports one further episode of hypoglycaemia in early July, again without warning symptoms, glucose 52 mg/dL on his spouse's meter. Diabetes management discussed in full: insulin regimen unchanged, fingerstick frequency unchanged at two to three per day. Reiterated that continuous monitoring is the appropriate next step and that the request remains pending with the plan.",
